; BUG-002 support: a CBORK library with an exported symbol
; (`public-a`) and a non-exported private helper (`private-helper`).
; The consumer in `bug_002_whole_library_import_no_w006.cddl`
; references `private-helper` (triggering the legitimate W003
; cross-file direct-use-export violation) and leaves the
; `public-a` export unreferenced.  Before the fix, the unused
; `public-a` export triggered a false W006.

;@ CBORK: Library
;@ CBORK: Export
public-a = uint

private-helper = bstr .size 16
